<title>UK: RMC drops Polish cement plans.</title>
<headline>RMC drops Polish cement plans.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK building materials group RMC Group Plc said on Friday it was abandoning plans to buy a majority stake in the Polish Nowa Huta Cement Works.  </p>
<p>The group said in June it planned to purchase a stake in the Polish business. But in a terse statement, RMC said its plans had foundered on the price of such a deal.</p>
<p>&quot;Since this announcement, it has not been possible to conclude satisfactory terms for the transaction and this has resulted in a decision by RMC not to take the matter further,&quot; the company stated.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
